#
# Original Fractint 20.04p17 official rule library:
# FRACTINT | Quartet { ; Adrian Mariano
# FRACTINT | ; from The Fractal Geometry of Nature by Mandelbrot
# FRACTINT |   angle 4
# FRACTINT |   axiom fb
# FRACTINT |   A=FBFA+HFA+FB-FA
# FRACTINT |   B=FB+FA-FB-JFBFA
# FRACTINT |   F=
# FRACTINT |   H=-
# FRACTINT |   J=+
# FRACTINT |   }
